<title>USA: Red Lion, Pa., schools yield 5.40 pct in 2012.</title>
<headline>Red Lion, Pa., schools yield 5.40 pct in 2012.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dolphin &amp; Brandbury Inc said Wednesday it priced $4.9 million Red Lion Area School District, Pa., general obligation bonds to yield 5.40 percent in 2012.</p>
<p>The pricing follows:</p>
<p>RED LION AREA SCHOOL DISTRICT</p>
<p>RE: $4,900,000*</p>
<p>YORK COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA</p>
<p>GENERAL OBLIGATION BONDS</p>
<p>SERIES OF 1996</p>
<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		   S&amp;P:</p>
<p>FSA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 12/16/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 09/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 03/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
