<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Thursday, November 21, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 19, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is not book entry.</p>
<p>This issue is pending through DTC.</p>
<p>Dolphin &amp; Bradbury, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
